# Analysis outputs: raw per-run data stays out of the repo, but the aggregated
# summaries and significance tests are paper evidence and ARE tracked. Anything
# a table or claim in the paper rests on must be reproducible from the repo.
Analysis/*
!Analysis/MetricsSummary/
!Analysis/RAG_Ablation/
!Analysis/Prompt_Ablation/
!Analysis/Hybrid_Ablation/
# Per-cell run files: 105 files, ~2 MB, regenerable by RunPromptAblations.py.
# The aggregated summary carries every number the paper cites.
Analysis/Prompt_Ablation/cell_*.xlsx
Analysis/Prompt_Ablation/_stale_preindex_rebuild/

